{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":213055,\"title\":\"Tower of Screaming Virgins\",\"tagline\":\"Every man was theirs to command. Each night three more were summoned to the tower to satisfy their lust. And still they hunger for more . . .\",\"overview\":\"King's swordsman Captain Buridan, hero of the Flanders campaign, returns to Paris to find it in a grip of fear -a \\\"vampire/witch\\\" in the \\\"Tower of Sin\\\" is luring young men to their deaths by offering them a night of sexual ecstasy followed by savage slaughter. Buridan is holding secrets of his own and his battle to save France from an evil Chancellor, an impotent King and a lascivious, wanton Queen make the battlefields of war seem like child's play.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dTakmv7vPIvO1DG4WkEYHos5osk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ygMtbKlIKJemkNRJ6SLyaW4ZMw9.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"voteCount\":11,\"year\":1968,\"runtime\":89,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"FR\",\"name\":\"France\"},{\"code\":\"DE\",\"name\":\"Germany\"},{\"code\":\"IT\",\"name\":\"Italy\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Franz Antel\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":37860,\"name\":\"Franz Antel\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9jLx4ugwSHY7ZtbWZtQ49xrce8m.jpg\"},{\"id\":37969,\"name\":\"Fritz Umgelter\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":50282,\"name\":\"Teri Tordai\",\"character\":\"Königin Marguerite de Bourgogne\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vIVg2qQZ6I9JUnAgNbJ1alfqCG2.jpg\"},{\"id\":112764,\"name\":\"Jean Piat\",\"character\":\"Bouridan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iMiNVpUwuVu2ybsJHWY2jRjYCau.jpg\"},{\"id\":33709,\"name\":\"Uschi Glas\",\"character\":\"Blanche du Bois\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pLtYUsfQk1HjIpCYud1Ohylz8tE.jpg\"},{\"id\":44439,\"name\":\"Véronique Vendell\",\"character\":\"Je